when a party archives the coin master a coin master
    and the coin master is a coin master with issuer an issuer
then it is not the case that the coin master is a coin master with issuer the issuer.

it must not be true that
    a party archives the coin master a coin master
    and the coin master is a coin master with issuer an issuer
    and the party is different from the issuer.

it must not be true that
    a party archives the coin master a coin master
    and it is not the case that the coin master is a coin master with issuer an issuer.

